(736, 266920, 'Peter Chernin', 'peter-chernin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/6c7tilaP8n2bYJB0H6BZyEkd64k.jpg', 'Peter Chernin (born May 29, 1951) is an American film and television producer, businessman and investor. He is the chairman and CEO of The Chernin Group (TCG), founded in 2010. TCG manages, operates and invests in media, entertainment, and technology businesses.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Peter Chernin, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.', 'Peter Chernin (born May 29, 1951) is an American film and television producer, businessman and investor. He is the chairman and CEO of The Chernin Group (TCG), founded in 2010. TCG manages, operates and invests in media, entertainment, and technology businesses.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Peter Chernin, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.', NULL, '1951-05-29', NULL, 'USA', 'Production', 2, 'Harrison, New York, USA', NULL, NULL, 'nm1858656', NULL, 'peterchernin', '2026-05-08 13:30:20', '2026-05-08 13:30:20', NULL),
(737, 36427, 'Jenno Topping', 'jenno-topping', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/tOti87QZZwyBp1iujzPTib9AwuU.jpg', 'Jenno Topping was born in Sagaponack, New York, USA. She is known for Hidden Figures (2016), Ford v Ferrari (2019), and St. Vincent (2014). She is married to Chris Moore. They have three children.\n\nVery little is known about the talented producer. According to some sources, she was born on 1 January 1970. However, the producer herself has not revealed information about her birthday. She does not seem to prefer to share information about her personal life and childhood.\n\nShe started her career as a co-producer in 1995 from the film The Brady Bunch Movie. Her films credit include 28 Days (2000), Surviving Christmas (2004), Seeking Justice (2011), Dawn of the Planet of the Apes (2014), Miss Peregrine’s Home for Peculiar Children (2016), Red Sparrow (2018), and Spies in Disguise (2019), many more.', 'Jenno Topping was born in Sagaponack, New York, USA. She is known for Hidden Figures (2016), Ford v Ferrari (2019), and St. Vincent (2014). She is married to Chris Moore. They have three children.\n\nVery little is known about the talented producer. According to some sources, she was born on 1 January 1970. However, the producer herself has not revealed information about her birthday. She does not seem to prefer to share information about her personal life and childhood.\n\nShe started her career as a co-producer in 1995 from the film The Brady Bunch Movie. Her films credit include 28 Days (2000), Surviving Christmas (2004), Seeking Justice (2011), Dawn of the Planet of the Apes (2014), Miss Peregrine’s Home for Peculiar Children (2016), Red Sparrow (2018), and Spies in Disguise (2019), many more.', NULL, '1970-01-01', NULL, 'USA', 'Production', 1, 'Sagaponack, New York, USA', NULL, NULL, 'nm0867768', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-08 13:30:22', '2026-05-08 13:30:22', NULL),
