(746, 147156, 'Gaetano Aronica', 'gaetano-aronica', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/zesNYrMFw0fSGXi31gTlNQHsJyc.jpg', 'Gaetano Aronica (born 30 September 1963, in Agrigento) is an Italian actor known for playing the Roman general Varus in the 2020 Netflix television series Barbarians. He also starred in Malèna (2000), Il Capo dei Capi (2007) and Baarìa (2009).\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Gaetano Aronica, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.', 'Gaetano Aronica (born 30 September 1963, in Agrigento) is an Italian actor known for playing the Roman general Varus in the 2020 Netflix television series Barbarians. He also starred in Malèna (2000), Il Capo dei Capi (2007) and Baarìa (2009).\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Gaetano Aronica, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.', NULL, '1963-09-30', NULL, 'Italy', 'Acting', 2, 'Agrigento, Sicily, Italy', '[\"\\uac00\\uc5d0\\ud0c0\\ub178 \\uc544\\ub85c\\ub2c8\\uce74\"]', NULL, 'nm0036907', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-08 13:30:40', '2026-05-08 13:30:40', NULL),
