(839, 10830, 'Toby Emmerich', 'toby-emmerich', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/gXCYaYIwefc6q660TOWJbIDjHBQ.jpg', 'Toby Emmerich (born February 8, 1963) is an American producer, film executive, and screenwriter. He formerly served as the chairman of the Warner Bros. Pictures Group.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Toby Emmerich, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.', 'Toby Emmerich (born February 8, 1963) is an American producer, film executive, and screenwriter. He formerly served as the chairman of the Warner Bros. Pictures Group.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Toby Emmerich, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.', NULL, '1963-02-08', NULL, 'USA', 'Production', 2, ' New York City, New York, USA', '[\"\\u03a4\\u03cc\\u03bc\\u03c0\\u03b9 \\u0388\\u03bc\\u03bc\\u03b5\\u03c1\\u03b9\\u03c7\"]', NULL, 'nm0256497', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-08 13:33:42', '2026-05-08 13:33:42', NULL),
