(868, 408, 'James Keach', 'james-keach', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/7m1q8jK2fJCYCP8i9ks6e2pQJ6q.jpg', 'James Keach is an American actor, director and producer who has been active in Hollywood since the early 1970s. He is widely recognized for his work on the classic western film The Long Riders (1980) and for his award-winning documentaries. He is the son of actor Stacy Keach and the younger brother of actor Stacy Keach, Jr.', 'James Keach is an American actor, director and producer who has been active in Hollywood since the early 1970s. He is widely recognized for his work on the classic western film The Long Riders (1980) and for his award-winning documentaries. He is the son of actor Stacy Keach and the younger brother of actor Stacy Keach, Jr.', NULL, '1947-12-07', NULL, 'USA', 'Acting', 2, 'Savannah, Georgia, USA', NULL, NULL, 'nm0005077', 'pchfilms', NULL, '2026-05-08 13:34:38', '2026-05-08 13:34:38', NULL),
