(913, 1725893, 'Ben Rosenblatt', 'ben-rosenblatt', NULL, 'Ben Rosenblatt is a producer of feature films, television series, and short media. Previously an executive at Paramount Pictures and Bad Robot, Ben was Co-Producer on STAR TREK INTO DARKNESS, 10 CLOVERFIELD LANE, and STAR WARS: EPISODE VII - THE FORCE AWAKENS. He was also an Executive Producer of the long running TNT/AMC series Snowpiercer and was a Co-Executive Producer on the Paramount+ series KNUCKLES, the APPLE TV+ series THE BIG CIGAR, and the pilot episode of the HBO Max series TOKYO VICE. Ben has been Emmy Award nominated for his work as Co-Executive Producer on both the TNT series THE ALIENIST and the Netflix series RIPLEY as well as for his work as Executive Producer of the latest installment in Predator franchise, Hulu/20th Century Studios hit film PREY.', 'Ben Rosenblatt is a producer of feature films, television series, and short media. Previously an executive at Paramount Pictures and Bad Robot, Ben was Co-Producer on STAR TREK INTO DARKNESS, 10 CLOVERFIELD LANE, and STAR WARS: EPISODE VII - THE FORCE AWAKENS. He was also an Executive Producer of the long running TNT/AMC series Snowpiercer and was a Co-Executive Producer on the Paramount+ series KNUCKLES, the APPLE TV+ series THE BIG CIGAR, and the pilot episode of the HBO Max series TOKYO VICE. Ben has been Emmy Award nominated for his work as Co-Executive Producer on both the TNT series THE ALIENIST and the Netflix series RIPLEY as well as for his work as Executive Producer of the latest installment in Predator franchise, Hulu/20th Century Studios hit film PREY.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'USA', 'Production', 2, 'Los Angeles, California, USA', NULL, 'https://www.americanmeme.us', 'nm2845194', 'hollywoodben', NULL, '2026-05-08 13:36:02', '2026-05-08 13:36:02', NULL),
(914, 44936, 'Ginger Lynn', 'ginger-lynn', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/m6wD4bQAw0ApIjCnHOyYWMbhkfW.jpg', 'Born in Rockford, Illinois, on December 14, 1962, Ginger Lynn Allen went to California in 1982 to visit her ill grandfather. She decided to stay and found employment as a manager at a Musicland record store in Redlands. She had lived in a trailer in one of the worst parts of the city for almost a year when she answered an ad for figure models. This led to employment the same day and a layout in Penthouse magazine.\n\nWork in the adult-film industry soon followed. She worked in the industry from December 1983 through February 1986, making a total of 69 films (plus countless re-issues and compilations). She retired, partially because the work was no longer fun and she had very little time off. That same year, she was approached by the FBI to testify on behalf of Traci Lords, who had just been exposed as having been underage during her years in the adult-film industry. She refused and was eventually arrested for tax evasion.\n\nFollowing her years in adult movies, she appeared in many \"legit\" films throughout the late 1980s and 1990s-- most notably the \"Vice Academy\" films. She also starred in Metallica\'s music video \"Turn the Page.\" She has a son, whom she gave birth to on March 24, 1996. She tours gentlemen\'s clubs around the country, and signed a comeback deal with VCA Pictures in 1999. She has starred in four new adult movies so far: Torn (1999), White Lightning (2000), New Wave Hookers 6 (2000) and Taken (2005).', 'Born in Rockford, Illinois, on December 14, 1962, Ginger Lynn Allen went to California in 1982 to visit her ill grandfather. She decided to stay and found employment as a manager at a Musicland record store in Redlands. She had lived in a trailer in one of the worst parts of the city for almost a year when she answered an ad for figure models. This led to employment the same day and a layout in Penthouse magazine.\n\nWork in the adult-film industry soon followed. She worked in the industry from December 1983 through February 1986, making a total of 69 films (plus countless re-issues and compilations). She retired, partially because the work was no longer fun and she had very little time off. That same year, she was approached by the FBI to testify on behalf of Traci Lords, who had just been exposed as having been underage during her years in the adult-film industry. She refused and was eventually arrested for tax evasion.\n\nFollowing her years in adult movies, she appeared in many \"legit\" films throughout the late 1980s and 1990s-- most notably the \"Vice Academy\" films. She also starred in Metallica\'s music video \"Turn the Page.\" She has a son, whom she gave birth to on March 24, 1996. She tours gentlemen\'s clubs around the country, and signed a comeback deal with VCA Pictures in 1999. She has starred in four new adult movies so far: Torn (1999), White Lightning (2000), New Wave Hookers 6 (2000) and Taken (2005).', NULL, '1962-12-14', NULL, 'USA', 'Acting', 1, 'Rockford, Illinois, USA', '[\"Gynger Lynn\",\"Ginger Allen\",\"Ginger\",\"Ginger Lynne\",\"\\u30b8\\u30f3\\u30b8\\u30e3\\u30fc\\u30fb\\u30ea\\u30f3\"]', NULL, 'nm0000259', NULL, 'blameitonginger', '2026-05-08 13:36:05', '2026-05-08 13:36:05', NULL),
(915, 108562, 'Lisa Ann', 'lisa-ann', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/dyE3nuFUcMXIkjbub36NOVLzVv2.jpg', 'Lisa Ann is known to most of the world by her 20 plus years of success in the Adult Industry. During that time, she covered all bases from being the most searched adult star, to feature dancing, producing, directing, running a talent agency, hosting a radio show on Playboy/Spice radio on Sirius XM. A career highlight was her staring role in the Eminem Video \"We Made You\" where she appeared in another well known scenario, playing Sarah Palin which was derived from her claim to her fame in the infamous Hustler Series \"Who\'s Nailin Palin?\"\n\nLisa Ann shocked the world in December of 2014 with her retirement, which was announced by a handwritten letter on her Facebook Page. What the world didn\'t know was there were other secret passions yet to be uncovered. Her retirement was inspired by her new found success with SiriusXM Fantasy Sports Radio where she landed her first show, Lisa Ann Does Fantasy, covering fantasy sports. In that first year Lisa Ann claimed her first Fantasy Football trophy winning the SiriusXM Celebrity Host League. Lisa Ann had a well known mantra when secretly planning her retirement from the adult industry, she would say \"it\'s time to get out of bed and put some clothes on!\" Literally!\n\nAfter 1 full year of retirement, filled with endless hours of writing Lisa Ann released her autobiography The Life. The Life is a tell all, about what it was like to live in the clear heels of an adult star. The release of The Life was the first step in the exploration of the her love of writing, while opening the doors for endless opportunity.\n\nShe measures 38DD-20-34.', 'Lisa Ann is known to most of the world by her 20 plus years of success in the Adult Industry. During that time, she covered all bases from being the most searched adult star, to feature dancing, producing, directing, running a talent agency, hosting a radio show on Playboy/Spice 