(963, 1602696, 'Sanjar Madi', 'sanjar-madi', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/bBaJZKfoDyNgEGChmRLB4M69ISg.jpg', '**Sanzhar Madi (Madiev)** is a Kazakhstani actor and director. He was born on **August 4, 1986**, in **Almaty**.  Madi\'s film career began during his **second year of university**, when he started acting in commercials.  His **big-screen debut** took place in **2009**, when he was offered the lead role in **Kuat Isaev’s** detective action film *\"The Other Side\"*.  Some of the other films he has starred in include: *\"City of Dreams\"*, *\"The Tale of the Pink Rabbit\"*, *\"The Return\"*, *\"My Heart – Astana\"*, *\"The Book of Legends: The Mysterious Forest\"*, *\"Girlfriends\"*, *\"Knight’s Move\"*, *\"Ghost Hunting\"*, *\"The Golden Horde\"*, and others.', '**Sanzhar Madi (Madiev)** is a Kazakhstani actor and director. He was born on **August 4, 1986**, in **Almaty**.  Madi\'s film career began during his **second year of university**, when he started acting in commercials.  His **big-screen debut** took place in **2009**, when he was offered the lead role in **Kuat Isaev’s** detective action film *\"The Other Side\"*.  Some of the other films he has starred in include: *\"City of Dreams\"*, *\"The Tale of the Pink Rabbit\"*, *\"The Return\"*, *\"My Heart – Astana\"*, *\"The Book of Legends: The Mysterious Forest\"*, *\"Girlfriends\"*, *\"Knight’s Move\"*, *\"Ghost Hunting\"*, *\"The Golden Horde\"*, and others.', NULL, '1986-08-04', NULL, 'USSR (Kazakhstan)', 'Acting', 2, 'Alma-Ata, USSR (Kazakhstan)', '[\"\\u0421\\u0430\\u043d\\u0436\\u0430\\u0440 \\u041c\\u0430\\u0434\\u0438\",\"Sanzhar Madi\",\"Sanzhar Madiyev\",\"Sanzhar Madiev\",\"\\uc0b0\\uc790\\ub974 \\ub9c8\\ub514\\uc5d0\\ube0c\",\"\\u73ca\\u52a0\\u99ac\\u5e1d\",\"Sannjar Madi\"]', NULL, 'nm3751258', 'sanjar.madi', NULL, '2026-05-08 13:37:37', '2026-05-08 13:37:37', NULL),
