(972, 592804, 'Kiki Daire', 'kiki-daire', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/vSnuNcIE4vbkb2QzZ1SGgQIRNj0.jpg', 'Kiki Daire (born September 18, 1976 in Memphis, Tennessee, U.S.) is an American exotic dancer, porn star, and adult model. During Kiki Daire\'s childhood, she was a self-described “smart kid with a serious rebellious streak.” Kiki started out in the adult entertainment industry as a stripper in Memphis. During her career in stripping, Kiki danced in the Gold Club with her mother. According to Daire, her mother grew tired of competing with her daughter for tips, and thus got her fired.\n\nDaire began her entry in pornographic films in 1998 at the age of 22 with a Florida-based production. After reflecting on whether or not to pursue a career in pornography, she moved to Los Angeles, California and has since starred in hundreds of adult movies. She took a hiatus to move to New Orleans to attend college in the 2000\'s but has worked steadily in the industry since 2011.', 'Kiki Daire (born September 18, 1976 in Memphis, Tennessee, U.S.) is an American exotic dancer, porn star, and adult model. During Kiki Daire\'s childhood, she was a self-described “smart kid with a serious rebellious streak.” Kiki started out in the adult entertainment industry as a stripper in Memphis. During her career in stripping, Kiki danced in the Gold Club with her mother. According to Daire, her mother grew tired of competing with her daughter for tips, and thus got her fired.\n\nDaire began her entry in pornographic films in 1998 at the age of 22 with a Florida-based production. After reflecting on whether or not to pursue a career in pornography, she moved to Los Angeles, California and has since starred in hundreds of adult movies. She took a hiatus to move to New Orleans to attend college in the 2000\'s but has worked steadily in the industry since 2011.', NULL, '1976-09-18', NULL, 'USA', 'Acting', 1, 'Memphis, Tennessee, USA', '[\"Keki Dare\",\"Kike Daire\",\"Keki D\'Aire\",\"Keki D\'Air\",\"Kiki Dare\",\"Kiki D\'Aire\",\"Jennifer Elaine Bearden\",\"Jenna Scripps\",\"Jennifer Bearden\"]', NULL, 'nm0194915', NULL, 'kiki_daire', '2026-05-08 13:37:57', '2026-05-08 13:37:57', NULL),
