(1016, 45689, 'Sergej Moya', 'sergej-moya', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/rOTaoIk2jhVLyjtsAtbbiQ5zmuQ.jpg', 'Sergej Moya is a German actor, screenwriter, and director who has been appearing in feature films since 2001. Moya has also been working as a director since 2009.', 'Sergej Moya is a German actor, screenwriter, and director who has been appearing in feature films since 2001. Moya has also been working as a director since 2009.', NULL, '1988-01-04', NULL, 'Germany', 'Acting', 2, 'Berlin, Germany', NULL, NULL, 'nm1159827', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-08 13:39:21', '2026-05-08 13:39:21', NULL),
(1017, 1108120, 'Alia Bhatt', 'alia-bhatt', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/RBnTJPegPFLBS4VPsNLbf6iAoD.jpg', 'Alia Bhatt (born March 15, 1993) is a British and Indian actress and entrepreneur working mostly in Bollywood films.​ The daughter of filmmaker Mahesh Bhatt and actress Soni Razdan, she debuted as a child actor and slowly became one of India\'s highest-paid actresses. Her accolades include a National Film Award and six Filmfare Awards.', 'Alia Bhatt (born March 15, 1993) is a British and Indian actress and entrepreneur working mostly in Bollywood films.​ The daughter of filmmaker Mahesh Bhatt and actress Soni Razdan, she debuted as a child actor and slowly became one of India\'s highest-paid actresses. Her accolades include a National Film Award and six Filmfare Awards.', NULL, '1993-03-15', NULL, 'India', 'Acting', 1, 'Mumbai, Maharashtra, India', '[\"\\u963f\\u8389\\u96c5\\u00b7\\u5e03\\u54c8\\u7279\",\"\\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u06cc\\u0627 \\u0628\\u0627\\u062a\",\"\\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u06cc\\u0627 \\u0628\\u0647\\u0627\\u062a\"]', NULL, 'nm1017633', 'aliaabhatt', 'Aliaa08', '2026-05-08 13:39:24', '2026-05-08 13:39:24', NULL),
(1018, 224223, 'Ranveer Singh', 'ranveer-singh', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/sRiwLmhduFghJo8U2coUafnDD4C.jpg', 'Ranveer Singh Bhavnani (born 6 July 1985) is an Indian film actor who appears in Hindi films. After completing a bachelor\'s degree from Indiana University, Bloomington, Singh returned to India to pursue a career in film. He made his acting debut in 2010 with a leading role in Yash Raj Films\' romantic comedy Band Baaja Baaraat. The film emerged as a critical and commercial success, earning Singh a Filmfare Award in the Best Male Debut category.\n\nSingh went on to star in the romantic drama Lootera (2013), Sanjay Leela Bhansali\'s tragic romance Goliyon Ki Raasleela Ram-Leela (2013), his biggest commercial successes to that point, and in the action-drama Gunday (2014). In 2015, he starred in the ensemble comedy-drama Dil Dhadakne Do (2015), and portrayed Bajirao in the historical romance Bajirao Mastani, one of the highest-grossing Bollywood films, for which he garnered critical acclaim and won the Filmfare Award for Best Actor.', 'Ranveer Singh Bhavnani (born 6 July 1985) is an Indian film actor who appears in Hindi films. After completing a bachelor\'s degree from Indiana University, Bloomington, Singh returned to India to pursue a career in film. He made his acting debut in 2010 with a leading role in Yash Raj Films\' romantic comedy Band Baaja Baaraat. The film emerged as a critical and commercial success, earning Singh a Filmfare Award in the Best Male Debut category.\n\nSingh went on to star in the romantic drama Lootera (2013), Sanjay Leela Bhansali\'s tragic romance Goliyon Ki Raasleela Ram-Leela (2013), his biggest commercial successes to that point, and in the action-drama Gunday (2014). In 2015, he starred in the ensemble comedy-drama Dil Dhadakne Do (2015), and portrayed Bajirao in the historical romance Bajirao Mastani, one of the highest-grossing Bollywood films, for which he garnered critical acclaim and won the Filmfare Award for Best Actor.', NULL, '1985-07-06', NULL, 'India', 'Acting', 2, 'Mumbai, Maharashtra, India', '[\" \\tRanveer Singh Bhavnani\",\"\\u0420\\u0430\\u043d\\u0432\\u0438\\u0440 \\u0421\\u0438\\u043d\\u0433\\u0445\",\"\\u0631\\u0627\\u0646\\u0648\\u06cc\\u0631 \\u0633\\u06cc\\u0646\\u06af\"]', NULL, 'nm3828984', 'ranveersingh', 'ranveerofficial', '2026-05-08 13:39:26', '2026-05-08 13:39:26', NULL),
(1019, 35743, 'Jaya Bachchan', 'jaya-bachchan', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/gXmIdkOhJN7pa8XDR7KQJXgtXni.jpg', 'Jaya Bachchan (née Bhaduri; born April 9, 1948) is an Indian actress and politician. Celebrated for her work in Hindi and Bengali films since  her teenage debut in 1963, she has won eight Filmfare Awards and the Padma Shri, the fourth-highest civilian honour awarded by the Government of India. Regarded as one of the most celebrated actresses of Indian cinema, she was one of the highest paid actresses of the 1970s. She also serves as member of the parliament in the Rajya Sabha from the Samajwadi Party since 2004.', 'Jaya Bachchan (née Bhaduri; born April 9, 1948) is an Indian actress and politician. Celebrated for her work in Hindi and Bengali films since  her teenage debut in 1963, she has won eight Filmfare Awards and the Padma Shri, the fourth-highest civilian honour awarded by the Government of India. Regarded as one of the most celebrated actresses of Indian cinema, she was one of the highest paid actresses of the 1970s. She also serves as member of the parliament in the Rajya Sabha from the Samajwadi Party since 2004.', NULL, '1948-04-09', NULL, 'India', 'Acting', 1, 'Jabalpur, India', '[\"Jaya Bhaduri\",\"Jaya Bhaduri Bachchan\",\"\\u091c\\u093e\\u092f\\u093e \\u092d\\u093e\\u0926\\u0941\\u0930\\u0940\",\"\\u091c\\u092f\\u093e \\u092c\\u091a\\u094d\\u091a\\u0928\",\"\\u0414\\u0436\\u0430\\u044f \\u0411\\u0445\\u0430\\u0434\\u0443\\u0440\\u0438\",\"\\u0414\\u0436\\u0430\\u044f \\u0411\\u0430\\u0447\\u0447\\u0430\\u043d\"]', NULL, 'nm0080149', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-08 13:39:27', '2026-05-08 13:39:27', NULL);
