(1043, 3970051, 'Gwen Adora', 'gwen-adora', NULL, 'Gwen Adora is a performer, host, internet personality and pure joy based in Toronto, Canada. Known for her unapologetic approach to self-expression, body positivity, and queer representation, she is a standout presence in the digital space. Gwen has successfully merged her passion for fashion, drag, and self-love into engaging and relatable storytelling. In 2023, she starred as a subject in Netflix\'s MoneyShot documentary. Gwen\'s bubbly personality has lead to her co-hosting Siri Dahl\'s Corn Telethon (2024), bar tending on Watch What Happens Live with Andy Cohen (2023), and as an interviewee on Crave TV\'s 1 Queen, 5 Queers (2022). In addition to her mainstream pursuits, she is a multi-award winner in the adult industry.', 'Gwen Adora is a performer, host, internet personality and pure joy based in Toronto, Canada. Known for her unapologetic approach to self-expression, body positivity, and queer representation, she is a standout presence in the digital space. Gwen has successfully merged her passion for fashion, drag, and self-love into engaging and relatable storytelling. In 2023, she starred as a subject in Netflix\'s MoneyShot documentary. Gwen\'s bubbly personality has lead to her co-hosting Siri Dahl\'s Corn Telethon (2024), bar tending on Watch What Happens Live with Andy Cohen (2023), and as an interviewee on Crave TV\'s 1 Queen, 5 Queers (2022). In addition to her mainstream pursuits, she is a multi-award winner in the adult industry.', NULL, '1995-07-16', NULL, NULL, 'Acting', 1, 'Canada ', NULL, NULL, 'nm8197254', 'gwenisadorable', 'GwenAdora', '2026-05-08 13:40:11', '2026-05-08 13:40:11', NULL),
