(1174, 1536085, 'ธนภพ ลีรัตนขจร', 'person-1778247669', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/zZCYpbtAe4axyySy0TYS8eICujw.jpg', 'Tor Thanapob Leeratanakachorn is a Thai-Chinese actor, singer, and model born in Bangkok. He studied at Adventist Ekkamai School, then joined Kasetsart University, where he studied at the Department of Packaging and Materials Technology, Faculty of Agro-Industry. Thanapop graduated with a Bachelor of Science in Packaging Technology from Kasetsart University on November 20, 2017.\n\nThanapop started his career in entertainment by performing in music videos like \'It\'s time to listen\' by Da-Endorphine. His debut as an actor was in the \'Club Friday: the Series\' episode \"Once in memory.\" In 2013, Thanapob was then cast in the popular Thai TV show, \'Hormones: The Series\' directed by Songyos Sugmakanan, playing the role of Phai. His role as Phai became his first notable role, growing his popularity. After that, he became an artist under Nadao Bangkok. From 2018 to 2019, Tor performed as part of the idol group Nine by Nine (9x9), a one-year project initiated by 4nologue. As a member of the group, he appeared in the 2018 TV series \"In Family We Trust\" and joined his fellow members on three tours, performing concerts across Thailand.\n\nThanapob is in a long-term relationship with Khaenapha Larpveroj (Meen), who works in the airline industry.', 'Tor Thanapob Leeratanakachorn is a Thai-Chinese actor, singer, and model born in Bangkok. He studied at Adventist Ekkamai School, then joined Kasetsart University, where he studied at the Department of Packaging and Materials Technology, Faculty of Agro-Industry. Thanapop graduated with a Bachelor of Science in Packaging Technology from Kasetsart University on November 20, 2017.\n\nThanapop started his career in entertainment by performing in music videos like \'It\'s time to listen\' by Da-Endorphine. His debut as an actor was in the \'Club Friday: the Series\' episode \"Once in memory.\" In 2013, Thanapob was then cast in the popular Thai TV show, \'Hormones: The Series\' directed by Songyos Sugmakanan, playing the role of Phai. His role as Phai became his first notable role, growing his popularity. After that, he became an artist under Nadao Bangkok. From 2018 to 2019, Tor performed as part of the idol group Nine by Nine (9x9), a one-year project initiated by 4nologue. As a member of the group, he appeared in the 2018 TV series \"In Family We Trust\" and joined his fellow members on three tours, performing concerts across Thailand.\n\nThanapob is in a long-term relationship with Khaenapha Larpveroj (Meen), who works in the airline industry.', NULL, '1994-02-14', NULL, 'Thailand', 'Acting', 2, 'Bangkok, Thailand', '[\"\\ud0c0\\ub098\\ud3fd \\ub9ac\\ub77c\\ub530\\ub098\\uce74\\ucac0\",\"\\u0e15\\u0e48\\u0e2d \\u0e18\\u0e19\\u0e20\\u0e1e \\u0e25\\u0e35\\u0e23\\u0e31\\u0e15\\u0e19\\u0e02\\u0e08\\u0e23\",\"\\u0422\\u043e\\u0440 \\u0422\\u0430\\u043d\\u0430\\u043f\\u043e\\u043f \\u041b\\u0438\\u0440\\u0430\\u0442\\u0430\\u043d\\u0430\\u043a\\u0430\\u0442\\u0436\\u043e\\u043d\",\"Tor Thanapob Leeratanakachorn\",\"\\u062a\\u0627\\u0646\\u0627\\u067e\\u0648\\u0628 \\u0644\\u06cc\\u200c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a\\u0627\\u0646\\u0627\\u06a9\\u0627\\u0686\\u0648\\u0631\\u0646\",\"Thanapob Leeratanakajorn\"]', NULL, 'nm6642813', 'thanapob_lee', 'LeeThanapob', '2026-05-08 13:41:09', '2026-05-08 13:41:09', NULL),
