(1400, 142000, 'Hans Morten Hansen', 'hans-morten-hansen', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/q6avDYFpDLCNHV5x3ILE02i3GmH.jpg', 'From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nHans Morten Hansen (born 1964 in Stavanger) is a Norwegian stand-up comedian, notable for holding the world record for longest stand-up performance since August 20, 2010.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Hans Morten Hansen, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.', 'From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nHans Morten Hansen (born 1964 in Stavanger) is a Norwegian stand-up comedian, notable for holding the world record for longest stand-up performance since August 20, 2010.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Hans Morten Hansen, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.', NULL, '1964-02-28', NULL, 'Norway', 'Acting', 2, 'Stavanger, Norway', NULL, NULL, 'nm4121173', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-08 13:46:02', '2026-05-08 13:46:02', NULL),
