(1634, 557210, 'Bejoy Nambiar', 'bejoy-nambiar', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/9tR68VDZc9XNX8wqGMymmTYnAxN.jpg', 'Bejoy Nambiar is an Indian film director, and screenwriter known for his work in Bollywood. He is mostly known for his critically acclaimed short films, Rahu and Reflections, starring Mohanlal. He was the winner of Sony PIX’ s Gateway to Hollywood, as the best director judged by Ashok Amritraj, Rajat Kapoor and Anurag Basu. He marked his feature film debut with the thriller Shaitan (2011).  He was one of the jury members for India Film Project in 2013.', 'Bejoy Nambiar is an Indian film director, and screenwriter known for his work in Bollywood. He is mostly known for his critically acclaimed short films, Rahu and Reflections, starring Mohanlal. He was the winner of Sony PIX’ s Gateway to Hollywood, as the best director judged by Ashok Amritraj, Rajat Kapoor and Anurag Basu. He marked his feature film debut with the thriller Shaitan (2011).  He was one of the jury members for India Film Project in 2013.', NULL, '1979-04-12', NULL, 'India', 'Directing', 2, 'Kannur, Kerala, India', NULL, NULL, 'nm2349060', 'bejoynambiar', 'nambiarbejoy', '2026-05-08 13:53:21', '2026-05-08 13:53:21', NULL),
