(1646, 5512256, 'Sam Locke', 'sam-locke', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/5e33CGwTztSLeSuurikvEF3AIjx.jpg', 'Sam Locke is a fast emerging actor already recognised for his varied debut roles. He uses his working class roots as motivation to succeed in the industry - also wanting to inspire others who are from similar backgrounds to work hard and chase something they\'re passionate about. known for playing PC Ryan in Michael Sheen\'s THE WAY for BBC1. Sam has a number of projects in the pipeline ready to be released and also he is working on both for screen and stage projects.\n\nSam has worked on projects in a plethora of genres which have allowed him to work on, and showcase a range of different styles. In addition to his acting career, Sam has also been involved in directing, producing, and writing passion projects.\n\nBorn in Merthyr Tydfil, South Wales, Sam began his love of acting at School, training in theatre and performing arts at UAL (In merthyr collage) and graduating from DE Montfort in 2023. So far all of his professional work has been for TV/film, but as a result of his studies he is a competent live performer. Outside of acting, Sam is passionate about Football, being loyal Liverpool fan for along as he can remember. He also loves nature, skateboarding, and keeping active.\n\nSam Locke continues to evolve as an actor, always looking for new and challenging roles that push boundaries.', 'Sam Locke is a fast emerging actor already recognised for his varied debut roles. He uses his working class roots as motivation to succeed in the industry - also wanting to inspire others who are from similar backgrounds to work hard and chase something they\'re passionate about. known for playing PC Ryan in Michael Sheen\'s THE WAY for BBC1. Sam has a number of projects in the pipeline ready to be released and also he is working on both for screen and stage projects.\n\nSam has worked on projects in a plethora of genres which have allowed him to work on, and showcase a range of different styles. In addition to his acting career, Sam has also been involved in directing, producing, and writing passion projects.\n\nBorn in Merthyr Tydfil, South Wales, Sam began his love of acting at School, training in theatre and performing arts at UAL (In merthyr collage) and graduating from DE Montfort in 2023. So far all of his professional work has been for TV/film, but as a result of his studies he is a competent live performer. Outside of acting, Sam is passionate about Football, being loyal Liverpool fan for along as he can remember. He also loves nature, skateboarding, and keeping active.\n\nSam Locke continues to evolve as an actor, always looking for new and challenging roles that push boundaries.', NULL, '2001-04-12', NULL, 'UK', 'Acting', 2, 'Wales, UK', NULL, NULL, 'nm11271517', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-08 13:53:43', '2026-05-08 13:53:43', NULL),
