(1699, 579295, 'Samuel Bottomley', 'samuel-bottomley', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/8ZocaRIa2sqH14LyoIeA2vCVO16.jpg', 'Samuel Bottomley is an English actor, born 14 June 2001 in Bradford. He made s professional debut in the 2011 film Tyrannosaur at the age of 9. His TV work includes Rocket\'s Island, Ackley Bridge and Somewhere Boy, the latter earning him a BAFTA nomination for Best Supporting Actor.', 'Samuel Bottomley is an English actor, born 14 June 2001 in Bradford. He made s professional debut in the 2011 film Tyrannosaur at the age of 9. His TV work includes Rocket\'s Island, Ackley Bridge and Somewhere Boy, the latter earning him a BAFTA nomination for Best Supporting Actor.', NULL, '2001-06-14', NULL, 'UK', 'Acting', 2, 'Bradford, West Yorkshire, England, UK ', NULL, NULL, 'nm3890987', NULL, '', '2026-05-08 13:55:20', '2026-05-08 13:55:20', NULL),
