(1710, 1649152, 'Jacob Batalon', 'jacob-batalon', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/53YhaL4xw4Sb1ssoHkeSSBaO29c.jpg', 'Jacob Batalon (/ˌbɑːtəˈlɒn, ˈbætəˌlɒn/) is an American actor. He had his breakout role as Ned Leeds in the Marvel Cinematic Universe beginning with Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017) and its sequels, Far From Home (2019) and No Way Home (2021), along with cameo appearances in Avengers: Infinity War (2018) and Avengers: Endgame (2019).\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Jacob Batalon, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.', 'Jacob Batalon (/ˌbɑːtəˈlɒn, ˈbætəˌlɒn/) is an American actor. He had his breakout role as Ned Leeds in the Marvel Cinematic Universe beginning with Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017) and its sequels, Far From Home (2019) and No Way Home (2021), along with cameo appearances in Avengers: Infinity War (2018) and Avengers: Endgame (2019).\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Jacob Batalon, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.', NULL, '1996-10-09', NULL, 'USA', 'Acting', 2, 'Honolulu, Hawaii, USA', '[\"\\uc81c\\uc774\\ucf65 \\ubc30\\ub35c\\ub7f0\",\"\\u96c5\\u5404\\u5e03\\u00b7\\u8c9d\\u5854\\u9686\",\"\\u062c\\u06cc\\u06a9\\u0648\\u0628 \\u0628\\u0627\\u062a\\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0646\"]', NULL, 'nm8188622', 'lifeisaloha', NULL, '2026-05-08 13:55:41', '2026-05-08 13:55:41', NULL);
