(1773, 29915, 'Joe Dallesandro', 'joe-dallesandro', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/h632/dtLU66GGm6Lis5ZMrseT0qei2Ii.jpg', 'Joseph Angelo D\'Allesandro (born December 31, 1948), better known as Joe Dallesandro, is an American actor, and Warhol Factory superstar. Although he never became a mainstream film star, Dallesandro is generally considered to be the most famous male sex symbol of American underground films of the 20th century, as well as a sex symbol of gay subculture.', 'Joseph Angelo D\'Allesandro (born December 31, 1948), better known as Joe Dallesandro, is an American actor, and Warhol Factory superstar. Although he never became a mainstream film star, Dallesandro is generally considered to be the most famous male sex symbol of American underground films of the 20th century, as well as a sex symbol of gay subculture.', NULL, '1948-12-31', NULL, 'USA', 'Acting', 2, 'Pensacola, Florida, USA', '[\"Joseph Angelo D\'Allesandro\",\"Little Joe\",\"Joe Catano\",\"Joe Dallessandro\",\"Joe D\'Alesandro\",\"Joe D\'allesandro\",\"Terry Stewart\"]', NULL, 'nm0198072', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-08 13:57:36', '2026-05-08 13:57:36', NULL),
